Package: wflowsync
Title: Streamlined Synchronization for Workflowr Projects
Version: 0.1.3
Authors@R: 
    person("Alexander", "Gysin", email = "258851030+alexander-gysin@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an intuitive, context-aware command-line interface and an 
    interactive Shiny gadget to streamline Git version control, package management 
    (via renv), and website publishing (via workflowr). Designed to reduce friction 
    when syncing data analysis projects to GitHub.
